    "Arrives with Apple's first analytics report, usually 24–48 hours after connecting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arriba amb el primer informe d'analítica d'Apple, normalment 24–48 hores després de connectar."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kommt mit dem ersten Analytics-Bericht von Apple, meist 24–48 Stunden nach dem Verbinden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llega con el primer informe de analíticas de Apple, normalmente 24–48 horas después de conectar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrive avec le premier rapport d'analyse d'Apple, généralement 24 à 48 heures après la connexion."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arriva con il primo report di analisi di Apple, di solito 24–48 ore dopo la connessione."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Komt binnen met Apples eerste analyserapport, meestal 24–48 uur na het verbinden."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chega com o primeiro relatório de análises da Apple, geralmente 24 a 48 horas após a conexão."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Появится с первым аналитическим отчётом Apple, обычно через 24–48 часов после подключения."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple'ın ilk analiz raporuyla gelir; bu genellikle bağlandıktan 24–48 saat sonradır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As soon as there's something to say: milestones, drops, keyword issues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tan bon punt hi hagi alguna cosa a dir: fites, caigudes, problemes de paraules clau."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sobald es etwas zu melden gibt: Meilensteine, Einbrüche, Probleme bei Schlüsselwörtern."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En cuanto haya algo que contar: hitos, caídas, problemas de palabras clave."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dès qu'il y a du nouveau : paliers, baisses, problèmes de mots-clés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appena c’è qualcosa da dire: traguardi, cali, problemi con le parole chiave."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zodra er iets te melden is: mijlpalen, dalingen, zoekwoordproblemen."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
