    "Hi! Could you turn on App Store Connect's analytics reports for %@? It takes an Admin API key and a single request per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOr open Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) with your Admin key once: it sends that request and doesn't keep the key. Thanks!": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hola! Podries activar els informes d'analítica d'App Store Connect per a %@? Cal una clau d'API d'administrador i una sola sol·licitud per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nO obre Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) un cop amb la teva clau d'administrador: envia aquesta sol·licitud i no guarda la clau. Gràcies!"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hallo! Könntest du die Analyseberichte von App Store Connect für %@ einschalten? Dafür braucht es einen Admin-API-Schlüssel und eine einzige Anfrage pro App:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOder öffne Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) einmal mit deinem Admin-Schlüssel: Es sendet diese Anfrage und behält den Schlüssel nicht. Danke!"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¡Hola! ¿Podrías activar los informes de analíticas de App Store Connect para %@? Hace falta una clave de API de administrador y una sola solicitud por app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nO abre Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) una vez con tu clave de administrador: envía esa solicitud y no guarda la clave. ¡Gracias!"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour ! Pourriez-vous activer les rapports d'analyse d'App Store Connect pour %@ ? Il faut une clé d'API Admin et une seule requête par app :\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOu ouvrez Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) une fois avec votre clé Admin : il envoie cette requête et ne garde pas la clé. Merci !"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ciao! Potresti attivare i report di analisi di App Store Connect per %@? Serve una chiave API Admin e una sola richiesta per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOppure apri Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) una volta con la tua chiave Admin: invia quella richiesta e non conserva la chiave. Grazie!"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoi! Kun je de analyserapporten van App Store Connect aanzetten voor %@? Daarvoor is een beheerders-API-sleutel nodig en één verzoek per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOf open Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) één keer met je beheerderssleutel: het stuurt dat verzoek en bewaart de sleutel niet. Bedankt!"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Olá! Podia ativar os relatórios de análise do App Store Connect para %@? É preciso uma chave de API de administrador e um único pedido por app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOu abra o Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) uma vez com a sua chave de administrador: envia esse pedido e não guarda a chave. Obrigado!"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Привет! Не мог бы ты включить отчёты аналитики App Store Connect для %@? Нужен API-ключ администратора и один запрос на приложение:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nИли открой Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) один раз со своим ключом администратора: он отправит этот запрос и не сохранит ключ. Спасибо!"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merhaba! %@ için App Store Connect analiz raporlarını açabilir misin? Bir Yönetici API anahtarı ve uygulama başına tek bir istek gerekiyor:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nYa da Vane'i (github.com/adrbn/vane) Yönetici anahtarınla bir kez aç: bu isteği gönderir ve anahtarı saklamaz. Teşekkürler!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
